`LICENSE` for the source-code license.

## Glyph geometry

`components/Glyph.qml` contains outline path data from Tabler Icons
(https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons), MIT License, Copyright (c)
2020-2024 Paweł Kuna. The paths are reproduced unchanged except that
relative move commands in the keyboard and refresh glyphs were rewritten
as the equivalent absolute coordinates.

## Fonts

The greeter uses IBM Plex Sans, IBM Plex Mono and IBM Plex Sans Condensed
(SIL Open Font License 1.1) from the system `ttf-ibm-plex` package. No font
files are redistributed in this repository.

## Media

The theme bundles no photographs, video or other third-party media. The
background is drawn in code (`components/HorneroSprite.qml` and
`components/HorneroMark.qml` reproduce HorneroOS's own mascot sprite and
mark geometry from HorneroOS/shell and HorneroOS/config). Earlier releases
shipped licensed Argentine stills and an optional video pack; their credits
and rights records remain in the Git history of this repository.

An administrator may point `backgroundImage` at their own picture or video;
that content is theirs and is not distributed with the theme.
